---
const CompnayName = "YourserviceVA";
---

<footer class="text-slate-800 py-16 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12">
    
    <!-- Branding -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-white font-bold text-2xl">
        <img src="/Logo.png" alt="Your Company Logo" class="w-32 h-auto" />
      </div>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        Brindamos los mejores servicios tecnológicos expertos para satisfacer sus necesidades únicas.
      </p>
      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61556250137883" target="_blank" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#142e2e] flex items-center justify-center hover:cursor-pointer hover:bg-lime-400 hover:text-[#0a1b1b] transition">
            FB
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@YourserviceVA" target="_blank" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#142e2e] flex items-center justify-center hover:cursor-pointer hover:bg-lime-400 hover:text-[#0a1b1b] transition">
            YT
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/your_serviceva/" target="_blank" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#142e2e] flex items-center justify-center hover:cursor-pointer hover:bg-lime-400 hover:text-[#0a1b1b] transition">
            IG
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Our Services -->
    <div>
      <ul class="space-y-4">
      <li><a href="#hero" class="hover:text-lime-400 transition font-bold">Inicio</a></li>
      <li><a href="#elegirnos" class="hover:text-lime-400 transition font-bold">Por qué elegirnos</a></li>
      <li><a href="#comoLoHacemos" class="hover:text-lime-400 transition font-bold">Cómo lo hacemos</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <ul class="space-y-4">
      <li><a href="#servicios" class="hover:text-lime-400 transition font-bold">Servicios</a></li>
      <li><a href="#testimonios" class="hover:text-lime-400 transition font-bold">Testimonios</a></li>
      <li><a href="#equipo" class="hover:text-lime-400 transition font-bold">Equipo</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Copyright -->
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800 text-center">
    <p>© Copyright 2026 - {CompnayName}. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
  </div>
</footer>